### UpdateStream with Python SDK

Source: https://docs.livekit.io/reference/other/egress/api

Starts a room composite egress with an RTMP stream output, then updates the stream by adding a new output URL. The update_stream method requires the egress ID from the started egress.

```python
from livekit import api


async with api.LiveKitAPI() as lkapi:
    info = await lkapi.egress.start_room_composite_egress(
        api.RoomCompositeEgressRequest(
            room_name="my-room",
            layout="speaker",
            stream_outputs=[api.StreamOutput(
                protocol=api.StreamProtocol.RTMP,
                urls=["rtmp://live.twitch.tv/app/<stream-key>"],
            )],
        )
    )


    info = await lkapi.egress.update_stream(
        api.UpdateStreamRequest(
            egress_id=info.egress_id,
            add_output_urls=["rtmp://a.rtmp.youtube.com/live2/stream-key"],
        )
    )
```

